exports[`NSW fee views (golden) > the platform fees page 1`] = `"<div class="space-y-6"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink mb-2">How StrataVerze charges</h2><ul class="text-sm text-ink-muted space-y-1 list-disc pl-5"><li>Every charge is a flat amount from the schedule below. StrataVerze never charges a percentage.</li><li>Each charge is shown, including GST, to the person taking the action before they confirm it.</li><li>StrataVerze takes no commission from strata managers and earns no interest on scheme money.</li><li>Moving money between the scheme&#x27;s own funds is never charged.</li></ul></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-5"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-turquoise mb-3"></div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted font-medium uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Subscription, Small (12 lots)</p><p class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-ink">$108.90 / month</p></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-5"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#FFD18B] mb-3"></div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted font-medium uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Charges not yet invoiced</p><p class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-ink">$1.10</p></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-5"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#B9F3E9] mb-3"></div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted font-medium uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">StrataVerze invoices</p><p class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-ink">0</p></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Charges</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Every StrataVerze charge for this scheme, newest first. Amounts include GST.</p></div></div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead><tr class="text-left text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted border-b border-line"><th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Date</th><th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Charge</th><th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">From</th><th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Payer</th><th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Status</th><th class="py-2 font-medium text-right">Amount</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-line"><tr><td class="py-2 pr-4 whitespace-nowrap">1 Oct 2026</td><td class="py-2 pr-4">Payment fee</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 text-ink-muted">Levy payment</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 text-ink-muted">the owners corporation</td><td class="py-2 pr-4"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full h-[22px] px-2.5 text-[11px] font-medium whitespace-nowrap bg-[#F1F5F9] text-ink-muted ">Not yet invoiced</span></td><td class="py-2 text-right tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap">$1.10</td></tr><tr><td class="py-2 pr-4 whitespace-nowrap">2 Oct 2026</td><td class="py-2 pr-4">Reminder</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 text-ink-muted">Debt recovery</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 text-ink-muted">Owners corporation, recoverable from owner</td><td class="py-2 pr-4"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full h-[22px] px-2.5 text-[11px] font-medium whitespace-nowrap bg-[#F1F5F9] text-ink-muted ">Not yet invoiced</span></td><td class="py-2 text-right tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap">$1.10</td></tr><tr><td class="py-2 pr-4 whitespace-nowrap">3 Oct 2026</td><td class="py-2 pr-4">Payment plan</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 text-ink-muted">Payment plan</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 text-ink-muted">the owners corporation</td><td class="py-2 pr-4"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full h-[22px] px-2.5 text-[11px] font-medium whitespace-nowrap bg-[#F1F5F9] text-ink-muted ">Not yet invoiced</span></td><td class="py-2 text-right tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap">$1.10</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">StrataVerze invoices</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">One invoice a month, billed in advance for the subscription and due on issue. Each is entered in the scheme&#x27;s accounts as a supplier invoice. Select a number for the PDF.</p></div></div><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">No invoices have been issued.</p></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div id="fee-schedule" class="scroll-mt-24"></div><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Fee schedule</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">The prices in force on 27 Oct 2026. Prices exclude GST unless shown otherwise.</p></div></div><div class="space-y-6"><section><h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-2">Subscription</h3><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead><tr class="text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line"><th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Item</th><th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Payer</th><th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium text-right">Ex GST</th><th class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium text-right">GST</th><th class="py-2 font-medium text-right">Total</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-line"><tr><td class="py-2 pr-4">Large scheme subscription (51 to 150 lots)<span class="text-ink-muted">, per month</span></td><td class="py-2 pr-4 text-ink-muted">Charged to the owners corporation</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 text-right tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap">$349.00</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 text-right tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap">$34.90</td><td class="py-2 text-right tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap">$383.90</td></tr><tr><td class="py-2 pr-4">Medium scheme subscription (11 to 50 lots)<span class="text-ink-muted">, per month</span></td