ont-semibold text-base text-ink">Owner</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">As recorded on the strata roll.</p></div></div><dl class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="min-w-0"><dt class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Owner (strata roll)</dt><dd class="break-words text-ink">J CITIZEN</dd></div><div class="min-w-0"><dt class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Email</dt><dd class="break-words text-ink">j@example.com</dd></div><div class="min-w-0"><dt class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Mobile</dt><dd class="break-words text-ink">—</dd></div><div class="min-w-0"><dt class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Phone</dt><dd class="break-words text-ink">—</dd></div><div class="min-w-0"><dt class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Postal address</dt><dd class="break-words text-ink">—</dd></div><div class="min-w-0"><dt class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Last settled</dt><dd class="break-words text-ink">—</dd></div><div class="min-w-0"><dt class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Unit entitlement</dt><dd class="break-words text-ink">40</dd></div></dl></div></div>"`;

